{"id":"0d40f4eb00112692","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-dtt-model-compat.md","title":"Compatibility alias","display":"df-dtt-model-legacy — Compatibility alias","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-dtt-model-compat","aliases":["16-df-dtt-model-compat","16-dtt-model"],"display":"df-dtt-model-legacy — Compatibility alias","depends_on":["[[16-df-dtt-model]]"],"revision_date":"2026-10-16","formalization_scope":"Compatibility entry for the strict strong-fragment model; obsolete LCCC functor interface removed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-dtt-model-compat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-dtt-model-compat</span><span>16-dtt-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dtt-model-legacy — Compatibility alias"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"16eda75ae9b57089\" href=\"?note=16eda75ae9b57089\" title=\"16-df-dtt-model\">16-df-dtt-model</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"formalization_scope","html":"Compatibility entry for the strict strong-fragment model; obsolete LCCC functor interface removed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DTTSig}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{DTTSig}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(S,\\rho)\">\\(M=(S,\\rho)\\)</span> 为候选严格语境族模型。二元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DTTModel}_\\Sigma(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{DTTModel}_\\Sigma(M)\\)</span> 的全部结构、解释与适用片段见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"16eda75ae9b57089\" href=\"?note=16eda75ae9b57089\" title=\"16-df-dtt-model\">16-df-dtt-model</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DTTModel}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\">\\(\\mathrm{DTTModel}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\\)</span> 是本文件引入的兼容谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DTTModel}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_\\Sigma(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{DTTModel}_\\Sigma(M).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DTTModel}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_\\Sigma(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{DTTModel}_\\Sigma(M).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>旧三参数接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DTTModel}_{\\Sigma,\\mathcal C}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{DTTModel}_{\\Sigma,\\mathcal C}(M)\\)</span> 已撤换，因为裸 LCCC 函子没有规定严格的类型/项解释。本兼容入口沿用文件链接，但统一使用规范二元接口。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-dtt-model","status":"resolved","id":"16eda75ae9b57089","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-dtt-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dtt-model","status":"resolved","id":"16eda75ae9b57089","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DTTSig}(\\Sigma)$；$M=(S,\\rho)$ 为候选严格语境族模型。二元 $\\mathrm{DTTModel}_\\Sigma(M)$ 的全部结构、解释与适用片段见 [[16-df-dtt-model]]。$\\mathrm{DTTModel}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}$ 是本文件引入的兼容谓词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{DTTSig}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"M=(S,\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DTTModel}_\\Sigma(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DTTModel}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DTTModel}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_\\Sigma(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{DTTModel}_\\Sigma(M).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DTTModel}_{\\Sigma,\\mathcal C}(M)","display":false}],"bytes":1072,"backlinks":[{"id":"16eda75ae9b57089","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本文件改变旧模型接口：现在是二元 $\\mathrm{DTTModel}_\\Sigma(M)$，其中 $M$ 自带全部语境族结构与常量赋值。旧三参数“普通函子到 LCCC”未能解释各判断，也混淆内涵与外延相等；兼容入口 [[16-df-dtt-model-compat]] 已同步，授权目录内无其他旧三参数使用者。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-188","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-dtt-model-compat|df-dtt-model-legacy — Compatibility alias]]"}],"outgoing":["16eda75ae9b57089"]}